The '''Gallo Mountains''' was a [[mountain]] chain that was located on the [[planet]] of [[Naboo]].<ref name="Trivia Gallery" /> The settlement of [[Dee'ja Peak]] was situated upon the summit of a mountain within this chain.<ref name="CoN">{{TCW|Crisis on Naboo}}</ref> At some point [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] went rock climbing in the Gallo Mountains, which she later recalled whilst on [[Mokivj]] during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Thrawn: Alliances">''[[Thrawn: Alliances]]''</ref>

